<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transport from Bhubaneswar to Chennai | Safe Two-Wheeler Shipping
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required to ship my bike from Bhubaneswar to Chennai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">To arrange Bike Transport From Bhubaneswar To Chennai you’ll need a valid vehicle registration certificate, a government‑issued photo ID (Aadhaar or PAN), the original insurance policy or a copy, and an e‑Way Bill generated for the interstate move. If the bike is financed, a No‑Objection Certificate from the lender may also be required.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad protect my bike from scratches during the journey?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each bike is loaded onto a hydraulic ramp trailer that eliminates manual lifting, then wrapped in a 7‑layer foam system comprising heavy‑duty bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, corrugated sheets, and stretch film. The bike is secured inside an enclosed container with ratchet lashings, ensuring zero‑scratch transit across the 1,295 km route.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike in real time while it travels from Bhubaneswar to Chennai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Shree Ashirwad equips every bike transport container with a GPS unit that feeds live location data to a customer portal. You receive instant notifications at each major checkpoint—Cuttack, Vizag, Vijayawada—and can view the exact position on a map, giving full visibility until doorstep delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical cost range for bike transport between Bhubaneswar and Chennai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing depends on bike size, chosen insurance coverage, and any additional services such as expedited handling. For a standard motorcycle, the cost usually falls between ₹4,500 and ₹7,200. Exact quotes are generated instantly after you share bike details, pickup address, and preferred delivery date.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance mandatory and what does the full‑coverage policy include?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Full‑transit insurance is optional but highly recommended. Our IRDAI‑approved policy covers 100 % declared value, protection against accidental damage, theft, fire, and natural calamities. In the unlikely event of a claim, you receive a swift settlement backed by documented proof and a dedicated claims team.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long will it take for my bike to reach Chennai and what factors could affect the timeline?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The standard transit time is 3‑5 days, covering the 1,295 km stretch via NH 16. Factors that may extend the timeline include extreme weather, unexpected road closures, or high‑volume holiday periods. Our live‑tracking system alerts you instantly if any deviation occurs, and we proactively adjust routes to stay on schedule.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What happens if my bike gets damaged despite the zero‑scratch guarantee?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">If any damage is reported, our on‑ground team conducts a thorough inspection, documents the issue with photos, and initiates the insurance claim process. Because we use a 100 % declared‑value policy, you are compensated for the full market value of the bike, and we cover all administrative fees.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
